<h1>sibling</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A <a href="node.html"><em>node</em></a> in a <a href="tree.html"><em>tree</em></a> that has the same <a href="parent.html"><em>parent</em></a> as another node is its sibling.
</p>


<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

<hr>

Go to the
<a href="https://www.nist.gov/dads/">Dictionary of Algorithms and Data
Structures</a> home page.

